    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "NEW TO THE MARKET\r\n\r\nCuslough, Brickens, Claremorris, Co. Mayo\r\n\r\nPrime c.0.75 Acre Building Site\r\n\r\nAn excellent opportunity to acquire a prime c.0.75 acre building site located in the peaceful countryside setting of Cuslough, Brickens, close to Claremorris and Knock.\r\n\r\nThe site enjoys a convenient location with all essential services passing nearby and offers the ideal opportunity to construct a family home, subject to the necessary planning permission being obtained.\r\n\r\nFeatures\r\n\r\n• Prime c.0.75 acre site\r\n• Attractive countryside location\r\n• All services passing by the site\r\n• Excellent road frontage\r\n• Quiet rural setting\r\n• Convenient to Claremorris, Knock and Ballyhaunis\r\n• Ideal family home site (subject to planning permission)\r\n• Strong local demand area\r\n\r\nLocation Highlights\r\n\r\n• Close to Brickens Village\r\n• Approx. 10 minutes to Claremorris\r\n• Approx. 10 minutes to Knock Village\r\n• Approx. 15 minutes to Ireland West Airport Knock\r\n• Easy access to the N17 Galway–Sligo route\r\n• Convenient to Ballyhaunis, Kiltimagh and surrounding towns\r\n\r\nGuide Price: €25,000\r\n\r\nViewing comes highly recommended and is strictly by appointment with the sole selling agent.\r\n\r\nMartin Finn & Nigel Dineen Auctioneers\r\n\r\nMIPAV MMCEPI\r\nPSRA Licence No. 002031\r\n\r\n094 9362216 | 086 2130723\r\n\r\nEverything we touch turns to SOLD\r\n\r\nDisclaimer\r\n\r\nThese particulars are issued for guidance only and do not form part of any contract. Intending purchasers should satisfy themselves as to the accuracy of all information provided."
      },
      {
